(9) a mortgage from the purchaser of real property granted to the seller or to a licensed real estate broker.

Sec. 2.

[515B.1-118] ESTOPPEL LETTERS OR CERTIFICATES; FEES PROHIBITED.

An association or the association's authorized agent may not directly or indirectly charge a fee for the preparation or delivery of an estoppel letter or certificate. Unauthorized fees or charges issued in violation of this section are void.
